(5522385, 797658, 65592, '<td valign="top">Just some comments on your picture that could help to score higher next time:<br/> <br/>1-Be carefull with the deep of field. Do a google search about "hyperfocal distance" to maximize your dof and avoid those foregrounds out of focus.<br/>2-Chromatic aberrations are quite noticeable in the horizon line, but this is easily fixable in postprocesing.<br/>3-It seems oversharpened to me, maybe a more subtle USM will help.<br/> <br/>Hope it helps!</td>', 'Just some comments on your picture that could help to score higher next time: 1-Be carefull with the deep of field. Do a google search about "hyperfocal distance" to maximize your dof and avoid those foregrounds out of focus.2-Chromatic aberrations are quite noticeable in the horizon line, but this is easily fixable in postprocesing.3-It seems oversharpened to me, maybe a more subtle USM will help. Hope it helps!', '2009-06-10 08:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
