(5522516, 797863, 43774, '<td valign="top">That''s a neat looking rock but you''ve got some technical problems with your photo. The horizon is tilted (that''s an easy fix), you''ve got dirt on your sensor (you can clean your sensor or clone it out) and there are some serious banding issues in the sky. The photo also looks grainy and overexposed. Keep trying!</td>', 'That''s a neat looking rock but you''ve got some technical problems with your photo. The horizon is tilted (that''s an easy fix), you''ve got dirt on your sensor (you can clean your sensor or clone it out) and there are some serious banding issues in the sky. The photo also looks grainy and overexposed. Keep trying!', '2009-06-10 10:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522524, 797685, 43774, '<td valign="top">When I saw the sea urchin and coral I was thinking this could be from Nfld....then I saw "Mt Pearl" on the ring.<br/> <br/>This is a nice photo, good DOF and clear. Good luck!</td>', 'When I saw the sea urchin and coral I was thinking this could be from Nfld....then I saw "Mt Pearl" on the ring. This is a nice photo, good DOF and clear. Good luck!', '2009-06-10 10:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
