(5522683, 796743, 71741, '<td valign="top">Lol, love the idea but think the execution could use a little work.  The whole image should be sharp but the glass and rocks are soft.  Not sure what is causing it, but the glass also seems to have a dirty feel to it.</td>', 'Lol, love the idea but think the execution could use a little work.  The whole image should be sharp but the glass and rocks are soft.  Not sure what is causing it, but the glass also seems to have a dirty feel to it.', '2009-06-10 12:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
