(5526687, 798071, 101702, '<td valign="top">The haloes are really visibile and I think make the image look too false. It looks like either the sky was replaced, or selectively darkened, both of which I believe are against the rules of basic editing.<br/> <br/>That said I really like the clarity of the rocks in the foreground and they lead you nicely to the ship in the distance.</td>', 'The haloes are really visibile and I think make the image look too false. It looks like either the sky was replaced, or selectively darkened, both of which I believe are against the rules of basic editing. That said I really like the clarity of the rocks in the foreground and they lead you nicely to the ship in the distance.', '2009-06-13 15:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526867, 796903, 45631, '<td valign="top">This may have worked much better if I could see the rocks more clearly.  The foliage and water are the dominant features of this image.</td>', 'This may have worked much better if I could see the rocks more clearly.  The foliage and water are the dominant features of this image.', '2009-06-13 20:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526873, 796679, 45631, '<td valign="top">The subject of this challenge ''rocks, stones, pebbles'' does not stand out in this image.  A polariser may have been useful for the above situation and work on your composition.  Draw the viewer into your image.</td>', 'The subject of this challenge ''rocks, stones, pebbles'' does not stand out in this image.  A polariser may have been useful for the above situation and work on your composition.  Draw the viewer into your image.', '2009-06-13 20:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
