(5527884, 797966, 81362, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting, sharpness, and balance. The rays of red-gold on the background keep it from being routine. Good title and nice collection of rocks too.</td>', 'Excellent lighting, sharpness, and balance. The rays of red-gold on the background keep it from being routine. Good title and nice collection of rocks too.', '2009-06-14 19:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527885, 798023, 81362, '<td valign="top">I''m liking the simplicity of three stones with differing sizes and colors but similar shape and texture. Should score high.</td>', 'I''m liking the simplicity of three stones with differing sizes and colors but similar shape and texture. Should score high.', '2009-06-14 19:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527886, 797460, 81362, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.', '2009-06-14 19:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527887, 798153, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well executed.</td>', 'Very creative and well executed.', '2009-06-14 19:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527888, 797846, 81362, '<td valign="top">Abstract yet on topic. Unusual and interesting.</td>', 'Abstract yet on topic. Unusual and interesting.', '2009-06-14 19:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527890, 796743, 81362, '<td valign="top">For some, this will approach an Andres Serrano or Robert Maplethorpe level of sacrilege. Nice high key image. Wish the rocks could be almost as sharp as the lettering.</td>', 'For some, this will approach an Andres Serrano or Robert Maplethorpe level of sacrilege. Nice high key image. Wish the rocks could be almost as sharp as the lettering.', '2009-06-14 19:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527891, 797445, 81362, '<td valign="top">The bright green really adds a lot to the composition.</td>', 'The bright green really adds a lot to the composition.', '2009-06-14 19:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527892, 797150, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Reminds me of hikes along the Columbia Gorge.</td>', 'Very pretty. Reminds me of hikes along the Columbia Gorge.', '2009-06-14 19:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527894, 797945, 81362, '<td valign="top">I''ll ignore the title and vote 8 for simplicity and dramatic lighting.</td>', 'I''ll ignore the title and vote 8 for simplicity and dramatic lighting.', '2009-06-14 19:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527896, 797658, 81362, '<td valign="top">Science fiction illustration material. Artful composition and color processing really adds a lot here.</td>', 'Science fiction illustration material. Artful composition and color processing really adds a lot here.', '2009-06-14 20:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527897, 797758, 81362, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful expression. Could be used in a classroom lesson about animal coloration helping to hide them in their environment.</td>', 'What a wonderful expression. Could be used in a classroom lesson about animal coloration helping to hide them in their environment.', '2009-06-14 20:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527900, 797729, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nicely sharp and interesting balance. I like the contrast with the green background. Would have gained points if taken from a slightly lower perspective to have all the background green and perhaps removing the white stone on top.</td>', 'Nicely sharp and interesting balance. I like the contrast with the green background. Would have gained points if taken from a slightly lower perspective to have all the background green and perhaps removing the white stone on top.', '2009-06-14 20:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527901, 797159, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good progression of sizes, and moist surface enhances the impact.</td>', 'Good progression of sizes, and moist surface enhances the impact.', '2009-06-14 20:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527902, 798076, 81362, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of places in Colorado. Interesting to have the flat/angular rock forms slightly echoed in cloud shapes.</td>', 'Reminds me of places in Colorado. Interesting to have the flat/angular rock forms slightly echoed in cloud shapes.', '2009-06-14 20:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527903, 797863, 81362, '<td valign="top">Great find.</td>', 'Great find.', '2009-06-14 20:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527904, 798122, 81362, '<td valign="top">The rocks are well selected and the fibures make for an interesting pair, so extra point for creativity. Very much needs to have the fabric background stretched tight underneath and not rising up in back until much further behind the objects (eliminating the shadows).</td>', 'The rocks are well selected and the fibures make for an interesting pair, so extra point for creativity. Very much needs to have the fabric background stretched tight underneath and not rising up in back until much further behind the objects (eliminating the shadows).', '2009-06-14 20:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527906, 797473, 81362, '<td valign="top">Crystals are very difficult to capture well. Having a few sharply focused facets against the irregular undulations of color generates a peaceful feeling.</td>', 'Crystals are very difficult to capture well. Having a few sharply focused facets against the irregular undulations of color generates a peaceful feeling.', '2009-06-14 20:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527907, 797721, 81362, '<td valign="top">Now that is cute.</td>', 'Now that is cute.', '2009-06-14 20:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527908, 798156, 81362, '<td valign="top">Took an extra second to figure out the cow. Pretty funny.</td>', 'Took an extra second to figure out the cow. Pretty funny.', '2009-06-14 20:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527914, 798026, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice collection of colors and shapes. Since those elements appear to be the main subject, I find myself wishing for greater depth of field.</td>', 'Nice collection of colors and shapes. Since those elements appear to be the main subject, I find myself wishing for greater depth of field.', '2009-06-14 20:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527919, 797883, 81362, '<td valign="top">Rocks as a literal presence instead of ice cubes as metaphorical rocks launches an interesting idea. Are the green stalks coffee plants? Might consider a version with a uniform background to simplify the image.</td>', 'Rocks as a literal presence instead of ice cubes as metaphorical rocks launches an interesting idea. Are the green stalks coffee plants? Might consider a version with a uniform background to simplify the image.', '2009-06-14 20:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527920, 798117, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very huge rock indeed. I like how the water looks in this image.</td>', 'Very huge rock indeed. I like how the water looks in this image.', '2009-06-14 20:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527922, 797910, 81362, '<td valign="top">And turned to stone too. A bit more focus/depth of field and starker side light might be worth trying.</td>', 'And turned to stone too. A bit more focus/depth of field and starker side light might be worth trying.', '2009-06-14 20:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527924, 798116, 81362, '<td valign="top">The progression of rock steps with a slight curve to the path might benefit from a lower camera position, maybe with a long focal length to compress them together a bit.</td>', 'The progression of rock steps with a slight curve to the path might benefit from a lower camera position, maybe with a long focal length to compress them together a bit.', '2009-06-14 20:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527925, 797984, 81362, '<td valign="top">Set up shots are more difficult than they seem. The background is nicely distant. Removing the shells from the composition might help it fit the challenge better, and the color of the light is consistent with tungsten bulbs, where a color balance adjustment could tame the yellow and allow the rocks to display their character better.</td>', 'Set up shots are more difficult than they seem. The background is nicely distant. Removing the shells from the composition might help it fit the challenge better, and the color of the light is consistent with tungsten bulbs, where a color balance adjustment could tame the yellow and allow the rocks to display their character better.', '2009-06-14 20:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527927, 797864, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks like a rock climbing practice wall. Tangential approach adds interest. Greater depth of field and positioning to reduce the non-wall background might change this from documentary to something more.</td>', 'Looks like a rock climbing practice wall. Tangential approach adds interest. Greater depth of field and positioning to reduce the non-wall background might change this from documentary to something more.', '2009-06-14 20:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527934, 797938, 71651, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I really like the silhouette.</td>', 'Very cool. I really like the silhouette.', '2009-06-14 20:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527941, 798159, 71651, '<td valign="top">I like it but I think it would have looked great if you hadn''t blown out the highlights in the sky. Using a graduated ND filer could help to bring some detail in the sky and make those pinks and blues pop.</td>', 'I like it but I think it would have looked great if you hadn''t blown out the highlights in the sky. Using a graduated ND filer could help to bring some detail in the sky and make those pinks and blues pop.', '2009-06-14 20:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527944, 798153, 71651, '<td valign="top">Really cool use (of glass?)to distort the music sheet below. Very good entry.</td>', 'Really cool use (of glass?)to distort the music sheet below. Very good entry.', '2009-06-14 20:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
