(5529670, 797244, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea but it looks like you might have done too much sharpening and noise reducing software?  I see unusually bright edges around your rocks and also the detail is lost on the smaller stones.  Using the original, this looks like it would have been a good candidate for a black and white photo.</td>', 'This is a great idea but it looks like you might have done too much sharpening and noise reducing software?  I see unusually bright edges around your rocks and also the detail is lost on the smaller stones.  Using the original, this looks like it would have been a good candidate for a black and white photo.', '2009-06-15 15:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529674, 797968, 67697, '<td valign="top">Per my personal tastes, I don''t feel the colortone is adding anything to the mood of the shot.  It''s too bad the leaves are in the foreground because it looks like you have a beautiful capture of the water.</td>', 'Per my personal tastes, I don''t feel the colortone is adding anything to the mood of the shot.  It''s too bad the leaves are in the foreground because it looks like you have a beautiful capture of the water.', '2009-06-15 15:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529680, 797869, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol so I had to go look up "gneiss" and i can see where you are squeaking it into the photo.  I guess I like natural water reflections so I would like to have seen a clearer view of the rocks in water.</td>', 'lol so I had to go look up "gneiss" and i can see where you are squeaking it into the photo.  I guess I like natural water reflections so I would like to have seen a clearer view of the rocks in water.', '2009-06-15 15:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529713, 797984, 67697, '<td valign="top">This scene is a little confusing to me because there are so many items to look at.  The first thing that catches my eye is the row of curved shells and it makes me wonder how it ties in with the stacked rocks.  So I guess what I am saying is that without this title, it''s not totally clear to me who the star of the photo is.</td>', 'This scene is a little confusing to me because there are so many items to look at.  The first thing that catches my eye is the row of curved shells and it makes me wonder how it ties in with the stacked rocks.  So I guess what I am saying is that without this title, it''s not totally clear to me who the star of the photo is.', '2009-06-15 15:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529720, 797445, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is such a pretty photo.  I love the colors in this.  The moss on the rocks looks almost like drapery.  Very cool.</td>', 'This is such a pretty photo.  I love the colors in this.  The moss on the rocks looks almost like drapery.  Very cool.', '2009-06-15 15:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529726, 797326, 67697, '<td valign="top">This looks great in black and white.  I love the contrast in rock textures.  Great timing with the capture of the water drop!</td>', 'This looks great in black and white.  I love the contrast in rock textures.  Great timing with the capture of the water drop!', '2009-06-15 15:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529735, 797287, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the color of the sky!  The starburst is in a greatspot as well.  Really helps to draw attention to the curve of the rock.</td>', 'I love the color of the sky!  The starburst is in a greatspot as well.  Really helps to draw attention to the curve of the rock.', '2009-06-15 15:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529744, 797960, 67697, '<td valign="top">This looks almost zen like.  Love the simplicity.  I like how you used the curve of the paper to create some flow in the scene.  I really like the texture of the rocks too.</td>', 'This looks almost zen like.  Love the simplicity.  I like how you used the curve of the paper to create some flow in the scene.  I really like the texture of the rocks too.', '2009-06-15 15:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529746, 796744, 67697, '<td valign="top">Construction challenge a little bit to early lol!  Where did you get these little figurines?  They are cool.  Great placement all over the stones.  You did a good job with creating a story here.</td>', 'Construction challenge a little bit to early lol!  Where did you get these little figurines?  They are cool.  Great placement all over the stones.  You did a good job with creating a story here.', '2009-06-15 15:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529752, 797658, 67697, '<td valign="top">It''s a clever idea to try and create an otherworldly scene but I have to wonder how this looks in it''s normal state?  It seems as tho you might have a beautiful scene on your hands.  When I see rocks and water I''m looking for a peaceful and soothing scene.  Here, with the contrast and extra sharpness, it''s almost an uncomfortable view.</td>', 'It''s a clever idea to try and create an otherworldly scene but I have to wonder how this looks in it''s normal state?  It seems as tho you might have a beautiful scene on your hands.  When I see rocks and water I''m looking for a peaceful and soothing scene.  Here, with the contrast and extra sharpness, it''s almost an uncomfortable view.', '2009-06-15 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529823, 798146, 72261, '<td valign="top">How can one be objective when voting for this photo?!</td>', 'How can one be objective when voting for this photo?!', '2009-06-15 16:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529886, 797675, 72261, '<td valign="top">So cute. Nice lighting</td>', 'So cute. Nice lighting', '2009-06-15 17:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530000, 797783, 106484, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Looks like the famous Antelope Canyon photos.</td>', 'Very nice. Looks like the famous Antelope Canyon photos.', '2009-06-15 18:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530007, 798124, 106484, '<td valign="top">Building looks a tad over done, but it''s a nice shot. Also, the shadow on the right is a little distracting. I''m wondering what the colour version is like.</td>', 'Building looks a tad over done, but it''s a nice shot. Also, the shadow on the right is a little distracting. I''m wondering what the colour version is like.', '2009-06-15 18:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530010, 798146, 106484, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice. Great colours...looks inviting.</td>', 'Wow, very nice. Great colours...looks inviting.', '2009-06-15 18:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530012, 797150, 106484, '<td valign="top">Nice greens. Were the plants blowing in the wind? It''s a shame they''re not sharper.</td>', 'Nice greens. Were the plants blowing in the wind? It''s a shame they''re not sharper.', '2009-06-15 18:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530023, 797234, 106484, '<td valign="top">Great composition.</td>', 'Great composition.', '2009-06-15 18:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530026, 797846, 106484, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Where on earth did you take it from?</td>', 'Interesting shot. Where on earth did you take it from?', '2009-06-15 18:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530031, 797473, 106484, '<td valign="top">It''s a little noisy, and it might have been better with a great depth of field.</td>', 'It''s a little noisy, and it might have been better with a great depth of field.', '2009-06-15 18:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530035, 797326, 106484, '<td valign="top">Good timing. I''m guessing you have about 100 outtakes? :-)</td>', 'Good timing. I''m guessing you have about 100 outtakes? :-)', '2009-06-15 18:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530039, 797838, 106484, '<td valign="top">Nice position, although I think it would have been better if you hung around until there were no people in the shot. Also, it''s a shame the rocks are so dark.</td>', 'Nice position, although I think it would have been better if you hung around until there were no people in the shot. Also, it''s a shame the rocks are so dark.', '2009-06-15 18:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530042, 797669, 106484, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t look like he wants to stay there. :-). Nice choice of rock....almost matches the toad''s texture. I added another point after revisting this...nice shot.</td>', 'He doesn''t look like he wants to stay there. :-). Nice choice of rock....almost matches the toad''s texture. I added another point after revisting this...nice shot.', '2009-06-15 18:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530045, 797826, 106484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I don''t like the pipe, and the shadowed area is quite dark....but still nice.</td>', 'Nice shot. I don''t like the pipe, and the shadowed area is quite dark....but still nice.', '2009-06-15 18:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530055, 798098, 106484, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but i''m sorry to say that it doesn''t really grab me. Might have been better with more subtle lighting perhaps, some light and dark areas....it''s very flat.</td>', 'Nice idea, but i''m sorry to say that it doesn''t really grab me. Might have been better with more subtle lighting perhaps, some light and dark areas....it''s very flat.', '2009-06-15 18:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530056, 797895, 106484, '<td valign="top">Might have been a tad more interesting taken much lower to the ground...but that''s just me. Nice.</td>', 'Might have been a tad more interesting taken much lower to the ground...but that''s just me. Nice.', '2009-06-15 18:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530153, 796903, 102019, '<td valign="top">you can''t really see the "rocks" in this piture... they weren''t the focus, and therefore I can''t give a high mark.</td>', 'you can''t really see the "rocks" in this piture... they weren''t the focus, and therefore I can''t give a high mark.', '2009-06-15 19:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
