(5532179, 798098, 61961, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The concept is so excellent I can only assume you''ve either seen it before or it will soon be borrowed from you!</td>', 'Nice shot.  The concept is so excellent I can only assume you''ve either seen it before or it will soon be borrowed from you!', '2009-06-17 00:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
