(5532243, 797280, 106233, '<td valign="top">15 min to voting deadline... I came here to bump some pics one point higher, as i normally do... suddently i saw a face on the bright side of your picture... dunno if this was your intention, but i bumped your score three up!</td>', '15 min to voting deadline... I came here to bump some pics one point higher, as i normally do... suddently i saw a face on the bright side of your picture... dunno if this was your intention, but i bumped your score three up!', '2009-06-17 00:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
