(5532312, 797234, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought it was cool to see so many stones layed out in such an interesting pattern.  I like how the light is falling on the stones so as to create the shadows and help keep the stones from blending together.  Cool photo.  Congrats on the top 20!</td>', 'I thought it was cool to see so many stones layed out in such an interesting pattern.  I like how the light is falling on the stones so as to create the shadows and help keep the stones from blending together.  Cool photo.  Congrats on the top 20!', '2009-06-17 01:08:22.000000', NULL, 0),
