(5532683, 797869, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent title!  And kudos to Paul for the other play on words.  Geology was one of my favorite classes in college.  As a somewhat unrelated aside, "Can Ollie See Down My Pants Pocket?  Tom Jones Can.  Tom''s Queer."  Geologic ages.  :-)<br/> <br/>Speaking of geology and past ages, there''s a giant beastie here sipping water from the pool.</td>', 'Excellent title!  And kudos to Paul for the other play on words.  Geology was one of my favorite classes in college.  As a somewhat unrelated aside, "Can Ollie See Down My Pants Pocket?  Tom Jones Can.  Tom''s Queer."  Geologic ages.  :-) Speaking of geology and past ages, there''s a giant beastie here sipping water from the pool.', '2009-06-17 04:57:04.000000', NULL, 0),
