(6450119, 798094, 12611, '<td valign="top">I live in a stone house, about 100 years old; there are all manner of things etched into it- this shot sums up a lot of it for me, the patterns of nature- circular, loosely patterned- within the context of man-made square and angular rectangle shaped stone.</td>', 'I live in a stone house, about 100 years old; there are all manner of things etched into it- this shot sums up a lot of it for me, the patterns of nature- circular, loosely patterned- within the context of man-made square and angular rectangle shaped stone.', '2011-06-22 09:53:08.000000', NULL, 0),
